sequenceDiagram
    title Basic SIP Call
    participant UserAgentA
    participant RedfireSwitch
    participant UserAgentB

    UserAgentA ->> RedfireSwitch: INVITE
    Note over UserAgentA,RedfireSwitch: Initial call setup
    RedfireSwitch -->> UserAgentA: 100 Trying
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentA: Call processing
    RedfireSwitch ->> UserAgentB: INVITE
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentB: Forward call to destination
    UserAgentB -->> RedfireSwitch: 200 OK
    Note over UserAgentB,RedfireSwitch: Call answered
    RedfireSwitch -->> UserAgentA: 200 OK
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentA: Forward answer
    UserAgentA ->> RedfireSwitch: ACK
    Note over UserAgentA,RedfireSwitch: Acknowledge call setup
    RedfireSwitch ->> UserAgentB: ACK
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentB: Forward acknowledgment
    UserAgentA ->> RedfireSwitch: BYE
    Note over UserAgentA,RedfireSwitch: End call
    RedfireSwitch ->> UserAgentB: BYE
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentB: Forward call termination
    UserAgentB -->> RedfireSwitch: 200 OK
    Note over UserAgentB,RedfireSwitch: Confirm termination
    RedfireSwitch -->> UserAgentA: 200 OK
    Note over RedfireSwitch,UserAgentA: Forward confirmation
